profile.LOW=Low
profile.LOW.comment=A smaller voxel box (96 blocks across), fewer light traces per pixel, three bounce rays per block, a 1024 shadow map.
profile.DEFAULT=Default
profile.DEFAULT.comment=A 128-block voxel box, 32 light traces per pixel, seven bounce rays per block, a 2048 shadow map.
profile.HIGH=High
profile.HIGH.comment=A 256-block voxel box, more light traces at twice the detail, thirteen bounce rays per block, a 4096 shadow map.

screen.LIGHT=Light
screen.LIGHT.comment=Block light, the bounce light and ambient occlusion.
screen.SHADOW=Shadows
screen.SHADOW.comment=The sun's and the moon's shadows.
screen.LOOK=Look
screen.LOOK.comment=Exposure, bloom, the light in the air and colour.
screen.VOXEL=Voxel Copy
screen.VOXEL.comment=The copy of the world around you that block light and bounce light are traced through.

option.UPSCALING=Upscaling
option.UPSCALING.comment=Draw the world smaller and let DLSS or FSR (through the Create Galore Bridge) bring it up to the window's size. Off: DLSS or FSR only anti-alias it.
option.RENDER_SCALE=Render Scale
option.RENDER_SCALE.comment=How big the world is drawn while upscaling, of the window's size each way.
option.RENDER_SCALE.suffix=×

option.BLOCK_LIGHT_REACH=Light Reach
option.BLOCK_LIGHT_REACH.comment=How far the brightest lights reach, in blocks. A torch reaches about two thirds as far.
option.BLOCK_LIGHT_STRENGTH=Light Strength
option.BLOCK_LIGHT_STRENGTH.comment=How bright block light is.
option.LIGHT_SATURATION=Light Colour
option.LIGHT_SATURATION.comment=How strongly lights take on their colour.
option.HAND_LIGHT=Held Light
option.HAND_LIGHT.comment=A torch or lantern in your hand lights the world around you.
option.PIXEL_LIGHT=Light Per Pixel
option.PIXEL_LIGHT.comment=Trace the nearby lights to the pixels on screen, for sharp shadows from block light. Off: the light per block alone (softer, cheaper).
option.PIXEL_LIGHT_SCALE=Light Detail
option.PIXEL_LIGHT_SCALE.comment=One light sample per this many pixels each way; the samples take turns over the pixels they stand for.
option.PIXEL_LIGHT_TRACES=Lights Per Pixel
option.PIXEL_LIGHT_TRACES.comment=How many of the nearby lights each sample traces.
option.LIGHT_SPECULAR=Light Highlights
option.LIGHT_SPECULAR.comment=Smooth and metal surfaces catch highlights from the lights.
option.GI=Bounce Light
option.GI.comment=Sunlight, skylight and block light bounce off the blocks around you and colour the shade.
option.GI_RAYS=Bounce Rays
option.GI_RAYS.comment=Rays traced from each block each frame for the bounce light.
option.GI_STRENGTH=Bounce Strength
option.SSAO=Ambient Occlusion
option.SSAO.comment=Corners and gaps darken softly.
option.AO_STRENGTH=Occlusion Strength

option.shadowMapResolution=Shadow Resolution
option.shadowDistance=Shadow Distance
option.shadowDistance.comment=How far the sun's shadows reach, in blocks. Keep it at least half the voxel box's width, or the block light misses blocks at its edge.
option.sunPathRotation=Sun Angle
option.sunPathRotation.comment=How far the sun's path tilts from straight overhead, in degrees.
option.SHADOW_SOFTNESS=Shadow Softness
option.SHADOW_ENTITIES=Mob Shadows
option.SHADOW_BLOCK_ENTITIES=Block Entity Shadows
option.SHADOW_MACHINES=Machine Shadows
option.SHADOW_MACHINES.comment=Create's machines and contraptions cast shadows.

option.EXPOSURE=Exposure
option.EXPOSURE.comment=The exposure is fixed (no adapting to dark or bright), so day, night and caves look as dark as they are. This shifts it, in stops.
option.BLOOM_STRENGTH=Bloom
option.LIGHT_FOG=Light in the Air
option.LIGHT_FOG.comment=A haze of coloured light around lamps, strongest at night, underground and in the Nether.
option.SATURATION=Saturation
option.NIGHT_BRIGHTNESS=Night Brightness
option.NIGHT_BRIGHTNESS.comment=How bright the moon is.
option.CAVE_BRIGHTNESS=Cave Brightness
option.CAVE_BRIGHTNESS.comment=The faint light where no sky reaches, so caves are never fully black.

option.VOXEL_BOX=Voxel Box
option.VOXEL_BOX.comment=The box around you that block light and bounce light are traced through.
value.VOXEL_BOX.0=96 × 64
value.VOXEL_BOX.1=128 × 96
value.VOXEL_BOX.2=256 × 128
option.VOXEL_LEVELS=Detail Levels
option.VOXEL_LEVELS.comment=Each level is half the width and twice the detail of the one before, so the finest is near you.

option.DEBUG_VIEW=Debug View
option.DEBUG_VIEW.comment=Shows one part of the lighting on its own.
value.DEBUG_VIEW.0=Off
value.DEBUG_VIEW.1=Albedo
value.DEBUG_VIEW.2=Normals
value.DEBUG_VIEW.3=Sun Shadow
value.DEBUG_VIEW.4=Block Light (Per Block)
value.DEBUG_VIEW.5=Block Light (Per Pixel)
value.DEBUG_VIEW.6=Bounce Light
value.DEBUG_VIEW.7=Voxel Copy
value.DEBUG_VIEW.8=Distance Field
value.DEBUG_VIEW.9=Ambient Occlusion
value.DEBUG_VIEW.10=Voxel Cells
value.DEBUG_VIEW.11=Voxel Colours
value.DEBUG_VIEW.12=Light Lists
